# Pages matches these rules on the path only, not the hostname — a rule
# written as https://www.gag.golf/* is silently ignored. Sending www and the
# old pages.dev address to gag.golf therefore has to be a Redirect Rule in the
# Cloudflare dashboard, not a line here. See docs/HANDOFF.md.

# The second locale was briefly published under /zh before the client set the
# language policy. Those URLs were live and listed in the sitemap, so they are
# redirected rather than left to 404 for anyone who opened or bookmarked one.
/zh          /fr            301
/zh/*        /fr/:splat     301

# "Event" became "Tournament" at the client's request: the word says what the
# competition actually is, and it is the word the golf world uses.
/events      /tournaments      301
/events/*    /tournaments/:splat  301
/fr/events   /fr/tournaments   301

# The Brand page was folded into About when the site was rebuilt around the
# youth-platform positioning, which has no separate brand section.
/brand       /about         301
/fr/brand    /fr/about      301
